{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ germany german) (+ netherlands dutch) 1848 (+ revolution revolutions constitutional constitution))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_143315727#8_386183245","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2","rank":1,"snippet":"development of Russia cause a revolution? The Revolution influenced a series of revolts that came to be known as the Springtime of Peoples? \" , \"segment\": \"History What caused the German Revolution of 1848? tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt  tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt  tttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttttt What was a result of the American revolution? the result of American revolution is to stay together. What was the German revolution in 1848 called? In English is March Revolution and in German is Vormärz  (pre-march period) What nations grew out of the Revolution of 1848? Many countries were involved in the European <cover>revolutions of 1848 such as France, Italy, Germany, the Netherlands, </cover>Poland, and Austria. However, this uprising had little political impact though it eliminated feudalism in Austria and Prussia and inspired reform in Denmark and the Netherlands. Was the revolution of 1848 successful? i woudnt say yes, i wouldnt say no. How was the French revolution of 1848 really two revolutions?\" , \"start_char\": 2805.000000 , \"title\": \"What was the result of the Revolution of 1848 in Germany? - Answers\" , \"url\": \"http://www.answers.com/Q/What_was_the_result_"}}
